 1. a = [10, 20, 30, 40]; len(a)                 4
 2. a[0], a[-1]  (negative: from the end)        [10, 40]
 3. a[10], a[-10]  (past either end)             IndexError, IndexError
 4. a[10] is already the raising form            IndexError
 5. a[10] if len(a) > 10 else 'none'             'none'
 6. a[1:3]  (stop excluded; no inclusive form)   [20, 30]
 7. a[1:3]  (the only slice form)                [20, 30]
 8. a[1:]  (to the end)                          [20, 30, 40]
 9. a[1:1 + 2]  (no start, length form)          [20, 30]
10. a[4:], a[5:]  (slice at / past the end)      [[], []]
11. b[5] = 99 on a 4-element copy                IndexError
12. d = a[:]; d[-5] = 1  (before the start)      IndexError
13. a[:2], a[-2:], [][0]                         [10, 20], [30, 40], IndexError
14. itemgetter(0, 2)(a); with 10 too             (10, 30), IndexError
15. [[]] * 3 then x[0].append(1)  (shared)       [[1], [1], [1]]
16. [[] for _ in range(3)] then y[0]... (fresh)  [[1], [], []]
17. flatten(nested) helper, chain one level      [[1, 2, 3, 4], [1, 2, [3, [4]]]]
18. c = [1, 2]; c.append(3), c.extend([4]), c    [None, None, [1, 2, 3, 4]]
19. c.pop(), c.pop(0), then c                    [4, 1, [2, 3]]
20. c.insert(0, 0), then c                       [None, [0, 2, 3]]
21. [*a, 5], [*range(1, 4)], f(*a) with *args    [[10, 20, 30, 40, 5], [1, 2, 3], (10, 20, 30, 40)]
22. a - [20]; sorted(set(a) - {20})              TypeError, [10, 30, 40]
